meta {
  name: Export
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/temarios/{{temarioId}}/exportaciones
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
}

params:query {
  pieza: teoria
  formato: pdf
  theme: ~light
}

docs {
  Returns the file as a binary attachment (Content-Disposition), not JSON — use Bruno's
  "Send and Download" or check the response body in binary/preview mode.

  pieza x formato compatibility (FormatoExportacion#soporta):
    teoria       -> docx, pdf, md
    evaluacion   -> docx, pdf, md, gs (Google Forms Apps Script)
    diapositivas -> pptx, pdf

  md and gs require PlanUsuario#permiteExportacionAvanzada (Pro). Everything else is
  available on Free, gated only by the daily export quota.
}
